## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed security work for a high visibility NFT ecosystem and related infrastructure modules.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s security work across NFT infrastructure, staking contracts, Solana programs, bridge components and cross chain systems.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
